OL,3,CMurder investigation after man shot
OL,4,Cinside vehicle in Newham
OL,6,FA murder investigation is under way
OL,7,Fafter a man in his 40s was found shot
OL,8,Fdead inside a vehicle in east London.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to St
OL,11,FBartholomew's Road, Newham, at around
OL,12,F3am on Tuesday and found a man with
OL,13,Fgunshot wounds, the Metropolitan
OL,14,FPolice said.
OL,16,FHe was pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,18,FA crime scene remains in place on St
OL,19,FBartholomew's Road and no arrests have
OL,20,Fyet been made.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/4
