CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1787075308
OL,3,CMurder investigation after man shot
OL,4,Cinside vehicle in Newham
OL,6,FThe man's family have been informed
OL,7,Fand are being supported by specialist
OL,8,Fofficers.
OL,10,FDetective Chief Inspector Dan Whitten,
OL,11,Fwho is leading the investigation,
OL,12,Fsaid: "Firstly, our thoughts remain
OL,13,Fwith the friends and family of the man
OL,14,Fwho has sadly died.
OL,16,F"We know this incident will cause
OL,17,Fconcern in the local area, and I want
OL,18,Fto reassure the community that my team
OL,19,Fand I are doing everything we can to
OL,20,Fdetermine what happened and trace
OL,21,Fthose responsible.
OL,26,@tD@GOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/4
