OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1787075308
OL,3,CMurder investigation after man shot
OL,4,Cinside vehicle in Newham
OL,6,F"Those in the area will continue to
OL,7,Fsee an increased police presence
OL,8,Fthroughout the day while these
OL,9,Finquiries continue.
OL,11,F"We are asking anyone with
OL,12,Finformation, or who may have witnessed
OL,13,Fanything in the early hours of the
OL,14,Fmorning, to please contact us.
OL,16,F"Any piece of information, no matter
OL,17,Fhow small, could be vital to our
OL,18,Finvestigation."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUxD@AOUzD@OO]
