OL,3,CMurder investigation after man shot
OL,4,Cinside vehicle in Newham
OL,6,FAccording to UK Government data there
OL,7,Fwere 32 homicides by shooting in
OL,8,FEngland and Wales between April 2024
OL,9,Fand March 2025, accounting for 6% of
OL,10,Fall homicides.
